---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base lang="en" title="Legal notice and privacy — PediBot" description="What PediBot is and is not, and what data it does (not) keep." path="/legal">
  <div class="narrow prose" style="padding:40px 18px">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal notice</p>
    <h1 style="margin-top:8px">What PediBot is — and is not</h1>
    <p>PediBot is an information service for parents and caregivers. It summarises published paediatric guidelines and shows you where each statement comes from. <b>It is not medical advice, it does not diagnose, and it does not replace your paediatrician, nurse or emergency services.</b> Always seek professional care for a sick child, and in an emergency call your local emergency number.</p>
    <p>The guidelines quoted belong to their authors (scientific societies, public health bodies). PediBot links the originals and does not claim their endorsement.</p>
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No account, no name, no e-mail. We never ask for personal data and you should not type any.</li>
      <li>Your questions and PediBot's answers are stored <b>anonymously</b> (a random session token, no IP address) to evaluate and improve answer quality. Conversation memory lasts 24 hours.</li>
      <li>Your IP address is used only as a salted hash for rate limiting and is not stored in clear.</li>
      <li>Your browser keeps a session token, your country choice and the night-mode setting locally. No advertising trackers.</li>
      <li>Shared answers (the "copy link" button) are public pages containing only the question and the answer.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>pedibot.ai@gmail.com</p>
  </div>
</Base>
